sentences.text:
In view of the enhancement of compensation invoking the provisions of order XLI Rule 33 of the Code of Civil Procedure the impugned judgment and award dated 28th July, 2020 passed in MVCs No.1103, 1104 and 1105 of 2017 by the Tribunal is modified by enhancing the compensation as follows:
(i) The claimants in MVC No.1103 of 2017 pertaining to Miscellaneous First Appeal No.101540 of 2020 are entitled for compensation of Rs.16,59,800/- as against Rs.15,92,000/- awarded by the Tribunal;
(ii) The claimants in MVC No.1104 of 2017 pertaining to Miscellaneous First Appeal - 35 - NC: 2023:KHC-D:10939-DB C/W MFA No. 101541 of 2021, No.101541 of 2020 are entitled for compensation of Rs.14,42,552/- as against Rs.15,56,000/- awarded by the Tribunal;
(iii) The claimants in MVC No.1105 of 2017 pertaining to Miscellaneous First Appeal No.101542 of 2020 are entitled for compensation of Rs.18,29,940/- as against Rs.17,80,000/- awarded by the Tribunal;
3.

4. The respondent shall deposit the compensation amount before the Tribunal within six days from the date of receipt of certified copy of this judgment;
5. Amount if any in deposit, shall be transmitted to the Tribunal forthwith;
6. Registry to draw award accordingly;
7. Send the copy of this judgment along with trial Court records to the concerned court.
